{"id":1539,"level":64,"name":"Ферзь проти коня","group":"Сила фігур","format":31,"description":"<div id='example_left'><p>The knight wants to capture a flag.<br /> Your queen is guarding the flags.</p>  <p>A queen is a very strong piece. Much stronger than a knight.<br /> If you play it well, the queen can catch the knight.</p>  <p><strong>Tip!</strong><br /> Move your queen two squares away from the knight. This stops the knight from passing. Then, force the knight to move closer to the edge.<br /><br /></p>  <h3>What do you have to do?</h3>  <p>Catch the black knight before it reaches a flag.</p></div><div id='example_right'><p><img src='img/blog/uploads/33187--9317-2017-09-27_13-03-30.png' alt='' width='320' height='321' /></p></div>","assignment":"","stickerID":11,"examples":[],"puzzles":[{"id":71749,"fen":"3n4/8/8/1Q6/8/8/8/FFFFFFFF w - 0 1 $NY","pgn":" 1-0","format":31,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":71750,"fen":"3n4/8/8/5Q2/8/8/8/FFFFFFFF w - 0 1 $NY","pgn":" 1-0","format":31,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":71753,"fen":"3n4/7Q/8/8/8/8/8/FFFFFFFF w - 0 1 $NY","pgn":" 1-0","format":31,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":71751,"fen":"3n4/8/8/8/8/8/Q7/FFFFFFFF w - 0 1 $NY","pgn":" 1-0","format":31,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":71752,"fen":"3n4/8/8/8/8/8/7Q/FFFFFFFF w - 0 1 $NY","pgn":" 1-0","format":31,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]}]}